@*
    Grant-picker sync is handled by client/lib/grant-picker-sync.js
    (loaded in _Layout.cshtml — SECURITY.md §6 no-inline-script rule).
    The data contract: .kw-grant-section[data-editor][data-kind],
    input.kw-grant-check, .kw-grant-all, textarea[data-editor-name],
    small[data-role="grant-count"] — all server-rendered by the
    _GrantPickers partial.

    This partial is a no-op placeholder kept for backward-compatibility
    with views that include it via <partial name="_GrantPickerScripts" />.
    The module is already loaded globally in _Layout.cshtml.
*@
